    "lead": "• Made silence options (\"Apathetic\" / \"Hostile\") full answer-style cards with icons (🤷/✋), checkmark animations, and hover states instead of small text buttons • Redesigned certainty & tolerance sliders with gradient tracks, custom thumb styling (hover:scale-110, shadow), tick marks, and value badges • Assigned 9 distinct category colors (indigo, emerald, sky, rose, violet, teal, amber, fuchsia, cyan) with colored pill badges and accent dots • Added mode selection cards with gradient backgrounds, decorative overlays, icons (⚡/🧭/🔬), clock estimates, and \"Best for first-timers\" badges • Replaced \"Restart\" text button with circular ↻ icon that rotates 180° on hover • Swapped (i) info circles for \"Learn more\" rounded pills with pulse animation on the first question • Added animated glow-pulse + scale effect to \"See Results\" button on final question • Implemented keyboard shortcuts (1-4 select, Enter confirm, S/H silence) with persistent hint bar and KBD-style badges • Added smooth slide-in/out question transitions, category transition banners, and question navigation dot indicators • Created auto-save toast notification with scale-in/out animation",
