    "lead": "### Engine & Architecture - Scale database to the full 230 denominations for the v2.0 Open Beta. - Implement Denomination Families as the core alignment result, shifting the primary matching logic for \"Quick Mode\" to group users by overarching theological traditions rather than single denominations. - Refactor and optimize `/api/calculate` to use precomputed denomination baselines from KV (`denomination_profiles.json`) plus D1 scoring data. Hoisted user-profile pre-calculation out of the loop, dropping Math CPU Time from ~400ms to ~50ms. - Correct Methodology v2.0 math in the API engine (fixed tAmp fraction logic and fully implemented proper `F_schism` structure). - Add `/api/dev/profile` Worker endpoint to pull a denomination’s per-question answers directly from D1 (joining `denomination_selected_options`, `denomination_answers`, and `answer_options`). - Implement developer tools modal with secret `mod` code unlock and auto-fill options (random answers, perfect denomination profile, custom ID testing).",
